sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant R as Router
    participant E as Engineering Agent
    participant S as Support Agent
    participant V as Reviewer
    participant Y as Synthesizer

    U->>C: Submit task
    C->>R: Select agents
    R-->>C: engineering_agent, support_agent
    C->>E: Minimal technical context
    E-->>C: status=resolved
    C->>S: Minimal customer context
    S-->>C: status=unresolved
    C->>C: Detect conflict
    C->>V: Review conflict
    V-->>C: Needs clarification
    C->>Y: Build final answer with uncertainty
    Y-->>U: Response + next action
